        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;div style=&#39;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px&#39;&gt;DESIGN NOTES&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45&#39;&gt;• User authentication fields are owned by the accounts module.&lt;br/&gt;• No UUID primary-key assumption is made in this conceptual design.&lt;br/&gt;• StudentSkill and StudentInterest are join models.&lt;br/&gt;• proficiency_level is retained because skill strength supports readiness and gap analysis, but allowed values require team confirmation.&lt;br/&gt;• Interest contains only name and category in the current design.&lt;br/&gt;• Final Django fields and constraints must align with the implemented backend and REST API contract.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fillColor=#f5f9ff;spacing=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
